{"id":"ws1-dhp-1","title":"Dhammapada Verses","titleEn":"","ref":"","source":"Pāḷi Workshop booklet · page 7","credit":"Pāḷi text and English translation as in Mor’s Pāḷi Workshop booklet.","section":"extra","collection":"workshop","group":"1 · sīla, dāna & saddhā","groupSub":"And Other Wholesome Qualities","paras":[{"t":[["yo","yo"],[" "],["ca","ca"],[" "],["vassa-sataṃ","vassa-sataṃ"],[" "],["jīve","jīve"],[","],["\n"],["dussīlo","dussīlo"],[" "],["asamāhito","asamāhito"],["."],["\n"],["ek’āhaṃ","ek’āhaṃ"],[" "],["jīvitaṃ","jīvitaṃ"],[" "],["seyyo","seyyo"],[","],["\n"],["sīlavantassa","sīlavantassa"],[" "],["jhāyino","jhāyino"],["."]],"en":"One may live a hundred years\nwith no sīla and no samādhi.\nBetter it is a single day of life\nfor one who has sīla and meditates.","lines":true,"ref":"Dhp 110"},{"t":[["idha","idha"],[" "],["modati","modati"],[" "],["pecca","pecca"],[" "],["modati","modati"],[","],["\n"],["kata-puñño","kata-puñño"],[" "],["ubhayattha","ubhayattha"],[" "],["modati","modati"],["."],["\n"],["so","so"],[" "],["modati","modati"],[" "],["so","so"],[" "],["pamodati","pamodati"],[","],["\n"],["disvā","disvā"],[" "],["kamma-visuddhim","kamma-visuddhim"],[" "],["attano","attano"],["."]],"en":"He rejoices here, he rejoices hereafter,\none who does good rejoices in both places.\nHe rejoices and is happy,\nrecollecting his pure deeds.","lines":true,"ref":"Dhp 16"},{"t":[["idha","idha"],[" "],["nandati","nandati"],[" "],["pecca","pecca"],[" "],["nandati","nandati"],[","],["\n"],["kata-puñño","kata-puñño"],[" "],["ubhayattha","ubhayattha"],[" "],["nandati","nandati"],["."],["\n"],["“"],["puññaṃ","puññaṃ"],[" "],["me","me"],[" "],["katan”ti","katan”ti"],[" "],["nandati","nandati"],[","],["\n"],["bhiyyo","bhiyyo"],[" "],["nandati","nandati"],[" "],["suggatiṃ","suggatiṃ"],[" "],["gato","gato"],["."]],"en":"He is delighted here, he is delighted hereafter,\none who does good is delighted in both places.\n[When thinking] “I have done good,” he is delighted,\nwhen